{"ticker":"SHYAMMETL","symbol":"SHYAMMETL","instrumentId":3171778,"name":"Shyam Metalics","industry":"NSE-Steel-Producers","about":"Shyam Metalics and Energy Ltd. is a prominent integrated metal producer in India, focusing on manufacturing steel, ferroalloys, and producing renewable energy. The company operates state-of-the-art steel plants, producing products such as sponge iron, TMT bars, and structural steel, catering to industries like construction, infrastructure, and manufacturing. Shyam Metalics also produces ferroalloys, which are critical inputs for the steel industry. The company emphasizes sustainability, leveraging energy-efficient practices and renewable energy sources to minimize its environmental impact. With a robust distribution network, Shyam Metalics serves both domestic and international markets, positioning itself as a key player in India’s steel and metal industry.","website":"www.shyammetalics.com","location":null,"exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:58:10.324Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":1294,"changePct":-1.753853162250392,"week52High":1332.3,"week52Low":761.45},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹36,120 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹21,077 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"69,783,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"167"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"45,875,747"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.35%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"3.13"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1.1"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"1.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.19"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.97"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"-10%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"26.25"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"5–31"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"9.3%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"72.73"},{"label":"Volume","value":"211,058"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"489,475"},{"label":"Master score","value":"73"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"59"},{"label":"Price strength","value